            "detailed_description": "<h1>Now on Steam</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Fast-paced is not even close to describing the speed of this game! This will be an ultimate test to your reaction and ability to perceive everything around you!<br><br><i><strong>Just follow these simple rules: Don’t stay on Red; Shoot your Enemies; Harness the speed! </strong></i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Insanely fast gameplay!</strong> – Speed up every 15 seconds! Test your human limits and dodge the barriers!<br></li><li><strong>7 Endless Levels</strong> – New features on each level, unlock the next one by reaching 30 seconds!<br></li><li><strong>Let the Music carry you!</strong> – Enjoy your flight with best beats of electronic music!<br></li><li><strong>Competitive Leaderboards!</strong> – Fly your way to the top of the leaderboard among your friends and then the whole World in each level!</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Fast-paced is not even close to describing the speed of this game! This will be an ultimate test to your reaction and ability to perceive everything around you!<br><br><i><strong>Just follow these simple rules: Don’t stay on Red; Shoot your Enemies; Harness the speed! </strong></i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Insanely fast gameplay!</strong> – Speed up every 15 seconds! Test your human limits and dodge the barriers!<br></li><li><strong>7 Endless Levels</strong> – New features on each level, unlock the next one by reaching 30 seconds!<br></li><li><strong>Let the Music carry you!</strong> – Enjoy your flight with best beats of electronic music!<br></li><li><strong>Competitive Leaderboards!</strong> – Fly your way to the top of the leaderboard among your friends and then the whole World in each level!</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Dodge! Shoot! Go faster! Break the sound barrier in this unbelievably fast game and go straight for the first place in the leaderboard of BARRIER X!",
